00:17:36,140 --> 00:17:39,797
Especially an innocent woman and that is

261
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:43,337
exactly what you've done
isn't it and your stand

262
00:17:43,420 --> 00:17:45,857
gets to hide from the victim the law and

263
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:50,517
the consequences that's
why i will judge you

264
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:54,997
myself i'm evil see
that's where you're wrong

265
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:58,417
evil is always the loser
it's the victor who

266
00:17:58,500 --> 00:18:01,077
has justice the victor being the last man

267
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:04,880
standing and how you win
in battle is irrelevant

268
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:18,677
see the loser is always
the evil one time to finish

269
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:22,677
you off really the loser's

270
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:26,580
evil emerald EMERALD SPLASH!

271
00:18:27,260 --> 00:18:29,100
Then let me show you.

272
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:33,430
What?

273
00:18:33,560 --> 00:18:34,760
There's no way.

274
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:37,397
No one can just deflect
the emerald splash.

275
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:39,600
Just how evil you are.

276
00:18:57,160 --> 00:19:00,660
I'll teach you justice with my stand!

277
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:11,260
Your stand has incredible power.

278
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:17,020
You caught me by surprise earlier
and scratched its chest a little.

279
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,540
I'm glad my stand isn't weak,

280
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:23,620
but sometimes it feels like it
can get more savage than I am.

281
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,974
That was a close call.

282
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:32,049
She'll be fine once
her wounds are treated.

283
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:34,500
Did a gas mic just burst?

284
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,337
He came from the doctor's office!

285
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:37,937
Everyone, stay in the classroom!

286
00:19:38,020 --> 00:19:39,837
I'll leave the cleanup to them.

287
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,979
I've had enough school for one day.

288
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:43,940
This guy needs to talk.

289
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:46,827
I want to hear everything
he knows about Dio.

290
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:21,067
I just have the most amazing
connection with my son right now.

291
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:24,137
Jotaro must be thinking about
me at school this very second.

292
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:25,860
I'm not thinking about you.

293
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:28,670
Jotaro!

294
00:20:28,753 --> 00:20:29,791
Why aren't you at school?

295
00:20:29,940 --> 00:20:32,116
And who is that boy on your shoulder?

296
00:20:32,600 --> 00:20:34,659
Is that blood that he's covered in?

297
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:35,810
Wait a sec.

298
00:20:35,893 --> 00:20:37,840
Please don't tell me you did that.

299
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:40,357
None of your business.

300
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:42,160
I need to find the old man.

301
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:45,937
Finding someone in this
big house really sucks.

302
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:48,597
I think you can find him
with Avdol right now.

303
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:50,386
They're both in the tea room.

304
00:20:53,540 --> 00:20:56,520
Oh, Jotaro, you never tell me anything.

305
00:20:57,240 --> 00:21:01,460
All that does is make me
worry about you all the time!

306
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:06,417
But still, I know that deep
down you really do mean well.

307
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:09,077
You're a very sweet little boy at heart.

308
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,780
Hey? Yes?

309
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:16,460
You're looking a little bit
pale this morning You all right?

310
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:21,530
Yay!

311
00:21:21,613 --> 00:21:23,260
I'm fine! Thank you!

312
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:27,860
I knew it.

313
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:32,960
Well, I hate to say it,
but it's too late for him!

314
00:21:33,620 --> 00:21:35,157
There's no way he'll make it.

315
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:38,460
He's got a few days
before he dies at most.

316
00:21:39,180 --> 00:21:41,337
Jotaro, this is not your fault.

317
00:21:41,420 --> 00:21:45,657
Trust me, do you want to know why
this man swore his allegiance to Dio?

318
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:47,860
and came to your school to kill you?

319
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:51,120
Look right here, and I will show you!

320
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:55,360
What the hell is that?

321
00:23:29,580 --> 00:23:30,900
This is very bad.

322
00:23:31,120 --> 00:23:32,020
At this rate.

323
00:23:32,260 --> 00:23:34,537
A little cold isn't bad from time to time.

324
00:23:34,620 --> 00:23:36,738
I have no idea why I want to either.

325
00:23:36,860 --> 00:23:39,440
This is the one thing I feared the most.

326
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:41,300
Tell me, what can we do?
